* Abdollahi 2025 modified dual-feedback RGC with negative-RC network, re-sized for 1 V / PTM90 against 7 PVT conditions
* LTspice: File > Open (All files) > this .net > Run.  Keep ptm90.lib in this folder.
* One analysis at a time: un-comment the one you want with ";" removed.
.include ptm90.lib
.temp 35

Vdd vdd 0 dc 1
Cpd in 0 450f
CL out 0 50f
Iin 0 in dc 0 ac 1
Ibn vdd vbn dc 20u
Mdn vbn vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=1u L=200n AD=0.2p AS=0.2p PD=2.4u PS=2.4u
Cbn vbn 0 2p
Mb in vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=23.76u L=200n AD=4.752p AS=4.752p PD=47.92u PS=47.92u
M1 out x in 0 nmos90 W=20.14u L=100n AD=4.028p AS=4.028p PD=40.68u PS=40.68u
R1 vdd out 692.88
M2 x in 0 0 nmos90 W=23.23u L=100n AD=4.645p AS=4.645p PD=46.85u PS=46.85u
R2 vdd x 635.92
M3 x out s3 0 nmos90 W=3.273u L=100n AD=0.6546p AS=0.6546p PD=6.946u PS=6.946u
R3 s3 0 5.9811k
C3 s3 0 31.248f

.ac dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.noise V(out) Iin dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.op
;Eye diagram: open the matching _eye.net file instead (transient with a PRBS7 current source).
.meas AC zt0 FIND mag(V(out)) AT 10Meg
.meas AC zpk MAX mag(V(out))
.meas AC f3db WHEN mag(V(out))=zt0/sqrt(2) FALL=1
.backanno
.end
